🐍 What is Python?

Python is a high-level, easy-to-learn programming language used to create software, websites, automation scripts, games, and much more.

It is one of the most popular programming languages in the world.

✅ Why Python is Popular?

Simple and easy syntax (easy English-like code)

Beginner friendly

Large community support

Works on Windows, Linux, Mac

Used in many fields

💻 Where Python is Used?

🌐 Web Development (like backend development)

🤖 Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning

📊 Data Science & Data Analysis

🔧 Automation & Scripting (DevOps work also)

🎮 Game Development

Since you are learning Linux, Git, Docker, and DevOps, Python is very useful for:

Writing automation scripts

Creating DevOps tools

Working with APIs

